[l_english.STATE_LORE_389]
Our Town was once a small town known to nopony. Starlight Glimmer once guided ponies here to her self-proclaimed path towards “equality”. After Starlight realized her mistakes and moved to Ponyville, Our Town returned to normal life.
After the formation of the Resistance, Our Town suddenly became the center of the world-renowned United Resistance. Refugees from other regions poured into Our Town, causing it to quickly grow into a large town and begin its industrialization. For military needs, Our Town is surrounded by defense facilities to guard against possible invasions at any time.
As the headquarters of the Resistance, this town witnessed Harmony from being severely damaged to being rekindled. Our Town always believes in hope. In the future, she will enter the unknown future with the Resistance together, and embrace a brand new tomorrow.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_389]
平等镇曾是一个不知名的镇子。星光熠熠曾在此引导小马们走上她自认“平等”的道路。在星光认识到错误并移居小马谷后，平等镇恢复了正常的生活。
抵抗军成立后，平等镇一跃成为世界皆知的联合抵抗组织核心。来自其他地区的难民涌入平等镇，使平等镇迅速成长为颇具规模的城镇，并开始了她的工业化之路。出于军事需要，平等镇外到处是防御设施，以随时防备可能的入侵。
作为抵抗军的大本营，这座城镇见证了谐律从重创到重燃。平等镇永远相信希望，未来，她将随抵抗组织共同踏入未知的未来，迎接崭新的明天。
